      <div class="hero-intro">
        <p>
          {% include bilingual.liquid en="I study system security and testing, and am now turning my attention to robotics. My current interests are robot security, the generation, collection and curation of robot data, and interoperability between different robots." zh="我做系统安全与测试，最近把研究重心转向了机器人。接下来，我想研究机器人的安全与攻防、数据生成与收集筛选，以及不同机器人之间的互操作。" %}
